string, having the SC7180 as a fallback.

Signed-off-by: Danila Tikhonov <danila@jiaxyga.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

